> in the java programmeers faq, has already been tried...)

Hi,

there are two things which are more UNIX-related than java specific.

Make sure that the DISPLAY variable is set to the host you are working
at.
The x-server on the display-host has to be told to allow other x-servers
to display something on its screens. (This is done with the "xhost"
command)

If you use appletviewer make sure that you use absolute number in the
applet-tag. Percentage values are only valid in browsers.

I hope that will help

Chris
